<title>POLAND: DEBICA JULY NET RISES TO PLN 5,4 MLN.</title>
<headline>DEBICA JULY NET RISES TO PLN 5,4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    5.39 vs  3.45</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	8.94 vs  6.40</p>
<p> Operating profit    6.48 vs  5.72</p>
<p> Sales		  58.55 vs 50.92</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    47.00 vs  16.64</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	68.37 vs  29.21</p>
<p> Operating profit    45.52 vs  29.90</p>
<p> Sales		  415.05 vs 354.47</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish tyre maker is Debica SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
